{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mewseum: Masterpieces</strong> is a relaxing game where you can solve hundreds of puzzles while revealing unique masterpieces. Unwind to the sound of a beautiful piano with classical music or listen to your own favorite audio while playing. The puzzles range from easy to medium difficulty, ensuring a smooth and frustration-free experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9How to Play:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your task is to paint squares and/or rectangles within the grid while following two simple rules:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each painted section must contain exactly one number.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The number indicates the exact size of the section you need to paint.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417690/extras/a6243f831ffc054be3397bca4e9da573.poster.avif?t=1773256060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417690/extras/a6243f831ffc054be3397bca4e9da573.webm?t=1773256060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417690/extras/a6243f831ffc054be3397bca4e9da573.mp4?t=1773256060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfa8<strong>Explore Art History\u2026 with Cats!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover reimagined versions of iconic paintings, where cats take center stage in some of the most famous artworks in history. The featured paintings include: <br>\ud83e\uddaa<i>Girl with a Pearl Earring</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83c\udfa8<i>Mona Lisa</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude40<i>The Scream</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728<i>Starry Night</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfe1<i>American Gothic</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddb5<i>Abaporu</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc6b<i>Arnolfini Portrait</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67\u200d\ud83d\udc67<i>Las Meninas</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417690/extras/4e7940bdb63a3d8d37d1a112fe85381c.poster.avif?t=1773256060\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417690/extras/4e7940bdb63a3d8d37d1a112fe85381c.webm?t=1773256060\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417690/extras/4e7940bdb63a3d8d37d1a112fe85381c.mp4?t=1773256060\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfae<strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2714 <strong>Auto-save with Steam Cloud</strong> \u2013 pause and continue anytime.<br>\u2714 <strong>Over 10 hours of content</strong>: Become a true artist as you reveal stunning paintings by solving relaxing and immersive puzzles. Unlock over 80 achievements and complete your collection!</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Tutorial","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417690/5387343540d8133193df93a588cbe04680423509.jpg"},{"name":"Girl with a Pearl Earring: 1st Region","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417690/c5d12713a3f756af4571bd00e241a2b3955a2519.jpg"},{"name":"Girl with a Pearl Earring: 2nd Region","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3417690/25368bf61c03f3ed9e1560c9521b41c94c948759.jpg"},{"name":"Girl with a Pearl Earring: 3rd Region","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/34176